0018                  (            os9.d):00927         P$SWI3              RMB       2                   SWI3 Entry Point $18
001A                  (            os9.d):00928         P$DIO               RMB       DefIOSiz            default I/O ptrs $1A
0026                  (            os9.d):00929         P$PATH              RMB       NumPaths            I/O path table $26
0036                  (            os9.d):00930         P$Signal            RMB       1                   Signal Code $36
